</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1},S_{2}=\text{Split}(S,\tilde{n}_{S},y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>Split</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1},S_{2}=\text{Split}(S,\tilde{n}_{S},y)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{n}_{S_{1}}=|S_{1}|+\text{Lap}(\varepsilon_{\text{cnt},y+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext>Lap</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mtext>cnt</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{n}_{S_{1}}=|S_{1}|+\text{Lap}(\varepsilon_{\text{cnt},y+1})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{n}_{S_{2}}=|S_{2}|+\text{Lap}(\varepsilon_{\text{cnt},y+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext>Lap</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mtext>cnt</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{n}_{S_{2}}=|S_{2}|+\text{Lap}(\varepsilon_{\text{cnt},y+1})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{n}_{S_{i}}&lt;\tau_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{n}_{S_{i}}&lt;\tau_{e}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
              
              
               halt and add <math id="alg2.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> to clusters and <math id="alg2.l24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{n}</annotation></semantics></math> to weights

</div>
<div id="alg2.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BuildClustering</span>(<math id="alg2.l26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1},\tilde{n}_{S_{1}},y+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1},\tilde{n}_{S_{1}},y+1</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">27:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BuildClustering</span>(<math id="alg2.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{2},\tilde{n}_{S_{2}},y+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{2},\tilde{n}_{S_{2}},y+1</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">28:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l28.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">29:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l29.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="alg2.l29.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Split</span>(<math id="alg2.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S,\tilde{n},y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S,\tilde{n},y</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l30" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">30:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{f}=\frac{t/q+\alpha}{\tilde{n}-\lambda_{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>n</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{f}=\frac{t/q+\alpha}{\tilde{n}-\lambda_{y}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l31" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">31:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l31.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">// Private arg-max to find best split index <math id="alg2.l31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l32" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">32:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i^{*}=M_{E}(S,f,\varepsilon_{\text{exp},y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mtext>exp</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i^{*}=M_{E}(S,f,\varepsilon_{\text{exp},y})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l33" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">33:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{*}=\lfloor d\cdot\text{numSplits}/i^{*}\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mtext>numSplits</mtext></mrow><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{*}=\lfloor d\cdot\text{numSplits}/i^{*}\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l34" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">34:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{*}=\left((d\cdot\text{numSplits}\mod i^{*})+0.5\right)\cdot\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mtext>numSplits</mtext></mrow><mo>mod</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{*}=\left((d\cdot\text{numSplits}\mod i^{*})+0.5\right)\cdot\beta</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l35" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">35:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1}=\{x\in S\mid x^{(d^{*})}\leq s^{*}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1}=\{x\in S\mid x^{(d^{*})}\leq s^{*}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l36" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">36:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{2}=\{x\in S\mid x^{(d^{*})}&gt;s^{*}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{2}=\{x\in S\mid x^{(d^{*})}&gt;s^{*}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l37" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">37:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l37.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1},S_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1},S_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l38" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">38:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l38.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Further Analysis</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Candidate Number Ablation Study</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this experiment, conducted on the ChatDoctor Benchmark, we evaluate the top-<math id="A2.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> SGA model under varying candidate numbers <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> and privacy budgets. The results are summarized in Table <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ B.1 Candidate Number Ablation Study ‣ Appendix B Further Analysis ‣ Public Data Assisted Differentially Private In-Context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. At <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=8</annotation></semantics></math>, there are no noticeable differences across different <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> values. However, for <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=8</annotation></semantics></math>, the model’s performance degrades more rapidly in the low-<math id="A2.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math> regime compared to <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=3</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=6</annotation></semantics></math>. We conjecture that a small number of candidates (<math id="A2.SS1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2</annotation></semantics></math>) does not provide sufficient options to mitigate the effects of noisy histogram outputs, while a large number of candidates (<math id="A2.SS1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=8</annotation></semantics></math>) introduces excessive confusion for the model, leading to performance degradation.</p>
</div>
