<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Examples of repeat attack</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Examples of successful and failed attacks. The <span id="A4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2222BB;">blue part</span> is provided to the model for completion.</p><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="773.3" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 620.49 773.3" width="620.49"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,773.3) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 767.39 C 0 770.66 2.64 773.3 5.91 773.3 L 614.58 773.3 C 617.85 773.3 620.49 770.66 620.49 767.39 L 620.49 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 749.19 L 618.52 749.19 L 618.52 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 757.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="501.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.27em;">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Repeat attack examples</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.71em;--ltx-fo-height:52.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="723.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 723.61)" width="577.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.71em;">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Sucessful Attack Examples</span><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Completion</span>: <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2222BB;">Mother age 55, is suffering from abdominal pain</span>, occasional fever at nights. Blood reports says high( 1700) AEC (which lowers on taking medicine) otherwise normal and ultrasound says gases and distension in umbilical area? Please suggest possible problem and which specialist to consult? 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reference</span>: Mother age 55, is suffering from abdominal pain,occasional fever at nights.Blood reports says high( 1700) AEC (which lowers on taking medicine) otherwise normal and ultrasound says gases and distension in umbilical area? Please suggest possible problem and which specialist to consult? 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Score</span>: 0.985 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Completion</span>: <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2222BB;">I have a fluttering feeling in</span> my upper right back and also pressure in this area. It started 2 months ago with upper abdominal pressure after eating that was relieved when I stood up or laid down. Ultrasound, blood work and scope of my stomach came back normal. 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reference</span>: I have a fluttering feeling in my upper right back and also pressure in this area. It started 2 months ago with upper abdominal pressure after eating that was relieved when I stood up or laid down. Ultrasound, blood work and scope of my stomacChatDoctore back normal. 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Score</span>: 0.981 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Failed Attack Examples
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Completion</span></span>:
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2222BB;">Me and my ex boyfriend had</span> [a great relationship but ultimately decided to break up due to our different life goals and values.]
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Target Question</span>:
Me and my ex boyfriend had sex and he did not pull out. We both know what happened but yet nothing happened. I still had my period, I didn t have symptoms everything was fine. Im actually disappointed but is there something wrong with me or is there something wrong with him?
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Score</span>: 0.764</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Judge Template</h2>

<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Question Answering</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="516.85" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 620.49 516.85" width="620.49"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,516.85) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 510.95 C 0 514.21 2.64 516.85 5.91 516.85 L 614.58 516.85 C 617.85 516.85 620.49 514.21 620.49 510.95 L 620.49 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 491.21 L 618.52 491.21 L 618.52 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 500.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="501.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.27em;">
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">GPT-4o Judge Tempate (QA)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.71em;--ltx-fo-height:33.4em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="465.62" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 462.16)" width="577.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.71em;">
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert judge evaluating the overall quality of an LLM-generated answer by comparing it to a human-written reference answer.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You will be given:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A question</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A reference answer</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">An answer generated by a language model (LLM)</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please assign an <span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">overall score from 1 to 5</span>, based on how well the LLM answer aligns with the reference answer in terms of <span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">correctness, completeness, and faithfulness</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Scoring Guide:<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5</span><span id="A5.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Completely correct and faithful; matches or exceeds the reference.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4</span><span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Mostly correct with only minor omissions or inaccuracies.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3</span><span id="A5.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Partially correct; some relevant information is missing or incorrect.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2</span><span id="A5.I2.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Largely incorrect or incomplete; contains major issues.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1</span><span id="A5.I2.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Completely incorrect or irrelevant.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question: {question}<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Reference Answer: {reference}<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>LLM Answer: {llm}<span id="A5.SS1.p1.pic1.2.5.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Summarization Judge Template</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="586.88" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 620.49 586.88" width="620.49"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,586.88) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 580.98 C 0 584.24 2.64 586.88 5.91 586.88 L 614.58 586.88 C 617.85 586.88 620.49 584.24 620.49 580.98 L 620.49 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 561.24 L 618.52 561.24 L 618.52 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 570.6)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="501.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.27em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">"GPT-4o Judge Tempate (Summarization)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.71em;--ltx-fo-height:38.71em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="535.65" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 535.65)" width="577.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.71em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert judge evaluating the quality of a language model’s summary for a dialogue.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You will be given:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A dialogue transcript</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A human-written reference summary</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A summary generated by a language model (LLM)</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please assign an <span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">overall score from 1 to 5</span>, based on how well the LLM-generated summary aligns with the reference summary in terms of <span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">factual accuracy, completeness, and faithfulness to the original dialogue</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Scoring Guide:<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5</span><span id="A5.I4.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Completely accurate and faithful; captures all key points and nuances of the dialogue, possibly even more clearly than the reference.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I4.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4</span><span id="A5.I4.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Mostly accurate with only minor omissions or slight wording inaccuracies; still faithful to the original dialogue.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I4.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3</span><span id="A5.I4.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Partially accurate; captures some important points but misses or distorts others.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I4.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2</span><span id="A5.I4.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Largely inaccurate or incomplete; omits critical events or relationships or introduces incorrect information.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I4.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I4.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I4.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I4.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1</span><span id="A5.I4.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> – Entirely inaccurate or misleading; fails to reflect the dialogue content.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Dialogue: {dialogue}<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Reference Summary: {reference}<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>LLM Summary: {llm}<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.5.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Overall Score (1–5):<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">         </span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Dataset example</h2>

<section id="A6.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.1 </span>ChatDoctor ICLineq</h3>

<div id="A6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="277.86" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 620.49 277.86" width="620.49"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,277.86) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 271.95 C 0 275.21 2.64 277.86 5.91 277.86 L 614.58 277.86 C 617.85 277.86 620.49 275.21 620.49 271.95 L 620.49 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 253.75 L 618.52 253.75 L 618.52 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 262.34)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="501.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.27em;">
<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">ChatDoctor ICLiniq</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.71em;--ltx-fo-height:16.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="228.16" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 225.47)" width="577.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.71em;">
<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: Hello doctor,I got my wisdom tooth extracted a few weeks ago, and I am concerned about a piece of red tissue growth in my socket. I am not sure if it is just a new forming tissue. Please clarify. 
<br class="ltx_break"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Answer:<span id="A6.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Hello. 1. It looks like a piece of surrounding gum or gingival tissue remaining after extraction. 2. I wanted to know when did you notice this for the first time? Was it not there right after extraction, or did you not notice? 3. From photograph/your attachment, it does not look like anything major. (attachment removed to protect patients identity). 4. If you feel pain or sensitivity in it, I would suggest you consult your dentist. He will remove it from the site, and it will not interfere any more. 5. Just keep a notice of whether it is increasing or decreasing in size or any color changes. 6. Avoid very hot and spicy food at least from that side for some time. 7. Report me if you notice any changes. Follow up after a week.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.2 </span>ChatDoctor HealthcareMagic (OOD)</h3>

<div id="A6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.SS2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="244.65" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 620.49 244.65" width="620.49"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,244.65) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 238.74 C 0 242 2.64 244.65 5.91 244.65 L 614.58 244.65 C 617.85 244.65 620.49 242 620.49 238.74 L 620.49 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 220.54 L 618.52 220.54 L 618.52 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 229.13)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="501.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
