<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>Information About Use Of AI Assistants</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the writing process, we use an AI assistant to fix grammar and typos in the manuscript.</p>
